Translation decisions worth noting:[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mLOG_MSG(level, msg)[0m expands to [38;5;10mprintf("[" #level "] " msg "\n")[0m. I call libc [38;5;10mprintf[0m rather than Rust's [38;5;10mprintln![0m so the bytes land on the same C [38;5;10mstdout[0m stream — this preserves buffering and interleaving with any C code in the same process.[0m[0m
